        },
        {
          "text": "“Kandi ubwo namanyuriraga abantu ibihumbi bine ya mitsima irindwi, mwateranyije ubuvungukira bwuzura ibitebo bingahe?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.20",
